@baseUrl = http://localhost:5180
@code = SGC-AAAA-BBBB

### Entrada autorizada (reemplace code con una credencial activa)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "{{code}}",
  "accessPointCode": "REC-01",
  "direction": "Entry"
}

### Segunda entrada sin salida: rechazada con AlreadyInside
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "{{code}}",
  "accessPointCode": "BOD-01",
  "direction": "Entry"
}

### Salida autorizada
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "{{code}}",
  "accessPointCode": "REC-01",
  "direction": "Exit"
}

### Salida sin entrada: rechazada con NotInside
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "{{code}}",
  "accessPointCode": "REC-01",
  "direction": "Exit"
}

### Credencial desconocida: rechazada con CredentialNotFound
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "SGC-ZZZZ-ZZZZ",
  "accessPointCode": "REC-01",
  "direction": "Entry"
}

### Punto de acceso inexistente: rechazada con AccessPointNotFound
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "{{code}}",
  "accessPointCode": "NO-EXISTE",
  "direction": "Entry"
}

### Tipo de movimiento inválido: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialCode": "{{code}}",
  "accessPointCode": "REC-01",
  "direction": "Sideways"
}
